DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260821T150000
UID:tribe-10102089@scaddingcourt.org
DESCRIPTION:Parenting 1234 provides support to parents/caregivers who need
  more specialized programs\, such as teen parents\, parents involved in CA
 S\, or parents who don’t feel like they fit into other parenting program
 s. This program allows parents to build self-esteem and become empowered w
 hile learning new skills and methods of parenting that are effective and a
 ppropriate. Hours of operation:Parenting One-to-One Support Walk-in(Zoom p
 hone- 437.700.0447 ): Fridays\, 10:00 am – 3:00 pm Summer 2026 session: 
 Ju
LOCATION:Scadding Court Community Centre\, 707 Dundas Street West\, Toront
 o
