DESCRIPTION:Nobody’ Perfect is a safe interactive setting where parents/
 caregivers can meet with other parents of young children (0-6 years) · Sh
 are questions or concerns and ideas about being a parent · Learn about ch
 ild development\, safety\, health and behaviour · Talks and sharing exper
 iences about real life parenting with the other parents · Work together w
 ith the trained facilitators to problem solve parenting issues · Discuss 
 ways to implement positive parenting With trained facilitated staff in wee
 kly
LOCATION:Scadding Court Community Centre\, 707 Dundas Street West\, Toront
