DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T153000
UID:tribe-10102250@scaddingcourt.org
DESCRIPTION:FREE Seniors’ stretch and strength program builds independen
 ce by improving balance\, mobility\, and daily function through controlled
  exercises like seated stretches\, bodyweight movements. The program focus
 es on increasing flexibility\, muscle mass\, and coordination to prevent f
 alls\, reduce stiffness\, and enhance overall well-being\, often incorpora
 ting warm-ups\, strength sets with modifications (like chair support) and 
 cooldowns with deep breathing.Fall 2026 session:Tuesdays: 11 am – 12 pm 
 Thursda
LOCATION:Scadding Court Community Centre\, 707 Dundas Street West\, Toront
